  "coverage": "How the states' deficit is financed: market borrowing, loans from the Centre, NSSF, provident funds, ₹ crore, 1970-71 on",
  "note": "RBI, The states' gross fiscal deficit and its financing (DBIE report 692; Handbook of Statistics on the Indian Economy). Amounts in ₹ crore (DBIE serves rupees). Financing items are net (Handbook note 5). Two codes for NSSF securities: the older one (to 1993-94) and the current one (from 1980-81), kept apart. Stages, from the printed table's own note: accounts to 2023-24, the revised estimate for 2024-25 and the budget estimate for 2025-26, each in its own series (suffix __re and __be), never one line. Cross-checked against the printed table (Innovation Hub export of Handbook report 212): 289 of 289 figures match."
